148
00:10:24.247 --> 00:10:25.890
Capacity: what runs out?

149
00:10:26.170 --> 00:10:30.714
A slot's capacity is the minimum over the resources the order consumes:

150
00:10:30.994 --> 00:10:39.911
Rider-minutes: the riders rostered for the zone in that window times 60, times a utilisation target (for example, 95%).

151
00:10:40.191 --> 00:10:44.117
Picker-minutes in the dark store for the picking wave that feeds the slot.

152
00:10:44.397 --> 00:10:48.087
Vehicle constraints: cold-chain bags, bulky-item vans.

153
00:10:48.367 --> 00:10:58.842
Each booking deducts its estimated cost in the scarce resource: ride out and back for its distance and hour, door time for its building, extra time for bulky baskets.

154
00:10:59.122 --> 00:11:03.709
