00:31:51.383 --> 00:31:57.741
The traffic term in the estimate removes almost all remaining lateness (712, then 21).

479
00:31:59.091 --> 00:32:04.232
The extra lost customers under C4 are the honest cost of saying full at booking time.

480
00:32:04.512 --> 00:32:06.112
L4 wins some of them back.

