503
00:34:44.280 --> 00:34:49.251
B2 is exact, but 1,043 transactions aborted and retried.

504
00:34:49.531 --> 00:34:55.227
B3 is exact with no retries, and has the highest throughput and lowest p99.

505
00:34:55.507 --> 00:34:57.128
B4 is exact too.

506
00:34:57.408 --> 00:35:04.917
Its 1,020 retries are version conflicts on hot slots, and in exchange it has the history L3 uses.

507
00:35:06.267 --> 00:35:09.147
