539
00:38:40.478 --> 00:38:42.867
WINNING BACK THE CUSTOMERS L1 TURNED AWAY.

540
00:38:43.147 --> 00:38:56.246
Same zone, roster and rider-minute capacity as L1 C4 (30 days, fixed seed). with demand close to what the riders can carry over the whole day, but over half of it wants 5 to 9 pm.

541
00:38:56.526 --> 00:38:57.529
When the preferred.

542
00:39:00.379 --> 00:39:01.296
On screen:

543
00:39:01.576 --> 00:39:19.944
One zone, 30 days, 16 hourly slots, rider-minute capacity (L1 C4); ~260 orders. wanted per day, over half for 5 to 9 pm. what the customer is shown served lost avg hours net fee rider util. from. preferred. change.

544
00:39:20.224 --> 00:39:21.035
(₹).

545
00:39:21.315 --> 00:39:32.173
S1) time-ordered list, full slots greyed 6,238 1,631 0.19 0 80.6%.

546
00:39:32.453 --> 00:39:42.971
